    },
    {
        "id": 120,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  49。位置我记住了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "49。位置我记住了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 121,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",name2=\"avg_npc_013\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_013",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 122,
        "raw": "[name=\"线人\"]  纸上是细节。整合运动渗透感染者聚落后的情报，没有发给其他头目，单线传递……一定是特殊目标。你得看看，越快越好。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "线人",
        "content": "纸上是细节。整合运动渗透感染者聚落后的情报，没有发给其他头目，单线传递……一定是特殊目标。你得看看，越快越好。"
    },
    {
        "id": 123,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",name2=\"avg_npc_013\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_013",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 124,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  好。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "好。"
    },
    {
        "id": 125,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",name2=\"avg_npc_013\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_013",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 126,
        "raw": "[name=\"线人\"]  咳……我可是，花了很大功夫才拿到……算了，陈sir，我没想到会有这天。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "线人",
        "content": "咳……我可是，花了很大功夫才拿到……算了，陈sir，我没想到会有这天。"
    },
    {
        "id": 127,
        "raw": "[name=\"线人\"]  虽然我起到作用了，可我没想到会是以这种方式。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "线人",
        "content": "虽然我起到作用了，可我没想到会是以这种方式。"
    },
    {
        "id": 128,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",name2=\"avg_npc_013\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_013",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 129,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  我们都没想到。因为你的努力，我们才有机会阻止敌人。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "我们都没想到。因为你的努力，我们才有机会阻止敌人。"
    },
    {
        "id": 130,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",name2=\"avg_npc_013\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_013",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 131,
        "raw": "[name=\"线人\"]  哈哈，咳，我没喜欢过龙门，龙门也没喜欢过我。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "线人",
        "content": "哈哈，咳，我没喜欢过龙门，龙门也没喜欢过我。"
    },
    {
        "id": 132,
        "raw": "[name=\"线人\"]  但现在，我居然给整个龙门做了点什么，一个街头仔能做到这步，值喇。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "线人",
        "content": "但现在，我居然给整个龙门做了点什么，一个街头仔能做到这步，值喇。"
    },
    {
        "id": 133,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",name2=\"avg_npc_013\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_013",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 134,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  中水三杰也算街头仔？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "中水三杰也算街头仔？"
    },
    {
        "id": 135,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",name2=\"avg_npc_013\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_013",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 136,
        "raw": "[name=\"线人\"]  有鬼姐在，我永远都是街头仔。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "线人",
        "content": "有鬼姐在，我永远都是街头仔。"
    },
    {
        "id": 137,
        "raw": "[name=\"线人\"]  ……",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "线人",
        "content": "……"
    },
    {
        "id": 138,
        "raw": "[name=\"线人\"]  ……陈sir，鬼姐她还好吗？还在当差吗？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "线人",
        "content": "……陈sir，鬼姐她还好吗？还在当差吗？"
    },
    {
        "id": 139,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",name2=\"avg_npc_013\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_013",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 140,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  还在。我和她搭档很长时间了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "还在。我和她搭档很长时间了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 141,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",name2=\"avg_npc_013\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_013",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 142,
        "raw": "[name=\"线人\"]  陈sir，鬼姐她……太耿直了。她在会里的时候没人，咳咳，敢动她。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "线人",
        "content": "陈sir，鬼姐她……太耿直了。她在会里的时候没人，咳咳，敢动她。"
    },
    {
        "id": 143,
        "raw": "[name=\"线人\"]  但她斗不过龙门的大人物。你一定得看好她。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "线人",
        "content": "但她斗不过龙门的大人物。你一定得看好她。"
    },
    {
        "id": 144,
        "raw": "[name=\"线人\"]  鬼姐绝对不能丢架，龙门那些趾高气扬的富人别想因为她的出身欺侮她！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "线人",
        "content": "鬼姐绝对不能丢架，龙门那些趾高气扬的富人别想因为她的出身欺侮她！"
    },
    {
        "id": 145,
        "raw": "[name=\"线人\"]  我只求你这一件事。就这一件。咳……",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "线人",
        "content": "我只求你这一件事。就这一件。咳……"
    },
    {
        "id": 146,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",name2=\"avg_npc_013\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_013",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 147,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  不会的。星熊很强，没人能动得了她。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "不会的。星熊很强，没人能动得了她。"
    },
    {
        "id": 148,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",name2=\"avg_npc_013\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_013",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 149,
        "raw": "[name=\"线人\"]  双拳难敌四手。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "线人",
        "content": "双拳难敌四手。"
    },
    {
        "id": 150,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",name2=\"avg_npc_013\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_013",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 151,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  整个近卫局都撑她。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "整个近卫局都撑她。"
    },
    {
        "id": 152,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",name2=\"avg_npc_013\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_013",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 153,
        "raw": "[name=\"线人\"]  那好，太好了，鬼姐，有陈sir在，我们都放心了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "线人",
        "content": "那好，太好了，鬼姐，有陈sir在，我们都放心了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 154,
        "raw": "[name=\"线人\"]  陈sir，你还在吗？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "线人",
        "content": "陈sir，你还在吗？"
    },
    {
        "id": 155,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",name2=\"avg_npc_013\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_013",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 156,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  在。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "在。"
    },
    {
        "id": 157,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",name2=\"avg_npc_013\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_013",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 158,
        "raw": "[name=\"线人\"]  我算不算是个好人？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "线人",
        "content": "我算不算是个好人？"
    },
    {
        "id": 159,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",name2=\"avg_npc_013\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_013",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 160,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  几年前，不好说。但现在你确实是。你是龙门引以为豪的好公民。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "几年前，不好说。但现在你确实是。你是龙门引以为豪的好公民。"
    },
    {
        "id": 161,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",name2=\"avg_npc_013\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_013",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 162,
        "raw": "[name=\"线人\"]  哈哈哈，咳，哈哈……矿石病衰仔也能是好人了？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "线人",
        "content": "哈哈哈，咳，哈哈……矿石病衰仔也能是好人了？"
    },
    {
        "id": 163,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",name2=\"avg_npc_013\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_013",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 164,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  有些龙门人会纠结矿石病，但你不如问问龙门城。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "有些龙门人会纠结矿石病，但你不如问问龙门城。"
    },
    {
        "id": 165,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",name2=\"avg_npc_013\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_013",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 166,
        "raw": "[name=\"线人\"]  怎么，我问它，它难道还会回答吗？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "线人",
        "content": "怎么，我问它，它难道还会回答吗？"
    },
    {
        "id": 167,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",name2=\"avg_npc_013\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_013",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 168,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  哈，我替它回答吧。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "哈，我替它回答吧。"
    },
    {
        "id": 169,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  “我不在乎。”",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "“我不在乎。”"
    },
    {
        "id": 170,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  阿发，你一直是、也永远是个龙门人。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "阿发，你一直是、也永远是个龙门人。"
    },
    {
        "id": 171,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",name2=\"avg_npc_013\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_013",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 172,
        "raw": "[name=\"线人\"]  谢谢你，陈sir。谢谢你。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "线人",
        "content": "谢谢你，陈sir。谢谢你。"
    },
    {
        "id": 173,
        "raw": "[name=\"线人\"]  陈sir，有两句话，我想你带给鬼姐。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "线人",
        "content": "陈sir，有两句话，我想你带给鬼姐。"
    },
    {
        "id": 174,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",name2=\"avg_npc_013\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_013",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 175,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  你自己和她说。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "你自己和她说。"
    },
    {
        "id": 176,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",name2=\"avg_npc_013\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_013",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 177,
        "raw": "[name=\"线人\"]  什么意思？你是说……",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "线人",
        "content": "什么意思？你是说……"
    },
    {
        "id": 178,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_013\")]",
